12> and morphisms\n<MATH_0013> lying over the projections\n<MATH_0014>.\n<STRUCT_0004> A morphism <MATH_0015> consists of a\ncollection <MATH_0016> of morphisms in\n<MATH_0017>, such that for every <MATH_0018> the diagram\n<MATH_0019>\ncommutes.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d1d75ac8e2570ce4f3450e6b11b4dc9b5aa4d4de6f647ae913b4b57311ea2894", "unit_id": "tag:06H2:prose-0003"}
